{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（25日）社交平台流傳兩段影片，拍攝到上水救護站對出的石上河有一頭小牛意外墮河，困於河道中。至少7名消防員接報趕至現場展開營救，一度利用撈網及繩子等工具試圖將小牛救起，惜未成功。最終有消防員決定親自將小牛抱起，並由岸上同袍合力接回安全位置，小牛最終成功獲救，蹦蹦跳奔跑回牛群。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防員涉水抱小牛上岸。（網民breatheart_hk ／Threads）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261025/1191001728472846336894157.jpeg/7IRKQrwQuzPXr3jWvIu5kFslV4LRF4pWZ8Gni2fBp4s\"/><figcaption>消防員涉水抱小牛上岸。（網民breatheart_hk ／Threads）</figcaption></figure><p>社交平台今日流傳相關片段，事發於上水救護站對出的石上河，小牛不知何故跌落河道之中，在水中徘徊無助。消防員初期曾嘗試利用撈網、繩子及捕捉桿等救援工具，希望將其救上岸，惟未能成功。其中一名消防員亦親自落水，涉水慢慢走到小牛身旁，將小牛抱起；岸上同袍則接應，合力將小牛拉上岸邊。小牛上岸後平安無事，奔跑回牛群。</p><p>事件引來不少途人及網民關注，有網民笑言見證溫馨一幕，形容「牛仔好開心，跑去媽媽度」，亦有人打氣：「牛牛下次小心啲啦！多謝咁多位消防員哥哥。」 也有人指出，「依條河 d（啲）牛成日跌落水被困」。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防員涉水抱小牛上岸。（網民breatheart_hk ／Threads）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261025/1191002046078128128617028.jpeg/YV8EppWEGfDUK7As917zPQiO3yF5Yd9u3VtEc91bRHM\"/><figcaption>消防員涉水抱小牛上岸。（網民breatheart_hk ／Threads）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員涉水抱小牛上岸。（網民breatheart_hk ／Threads）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261025/1191002048338989056369741.jpeg/fajhdJhmrC89TMMQoGg5L37HBiXTP3WzhFDiL4RQ4i8\"/><figcaption>消防員涉水抱小牛上岸。（網民breatheart_hk ／Threads）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員涉水抱小牛上岸。（網民breatheart_hk ／Threads）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261025/1191002050671153152409281.jpeg/JL5GWT9-mfKqYJDVAzp229JjheomGBvru6OwT7ujsE8\"/><figcaption>消防員涉水抱小牛上岸。（網民breatheart_hk ／Threads）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員涉水抱小牛上岸。（網民breatheart_hk ／Threads）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261025/1191002052818767872483192.jpeg/yB_JmciBvjtZql50bDxXKI_ETi2SSkknfsyIqn7MiKo\"/><figcaption>消防員涉水抱小牛上岸。（網民breatheart_hk ／Threads）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員涉水抱小牛上岸。（網民breatheart_hk ／Threads）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261025/1191002055092211712523940.jpeg/pESI0A6EXjZRriXwC8-ZIcn3arGoUq3WpkqNpqZKjaY\"/><figcaption>消防員涉水抱小牛上岸。（網民breatheart_hk ／Threads）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:04.629412+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":618,"images":6,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T05:25:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T08:41:09.679463+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:48.120709+00:00","content_hash":"48c5fefdaca0a69d03dca1db446e0f6579758326b0c15093ae7e028f492c623d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}